sequenceDiagram
    actor M as Manager
    participant App as Mobile App
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database

    M->>App: Buka tab Dashboard

    par Load statistik ringkasan
        App->>API: GET /api/v1/dashboard/summary
        API->>DB: SELECT COUNT booking per status
        DB-->>API: Data summary
        API-->>App: total, open, in_progress, done
    and Load performa teknisi
        App->>API: GET /api/v1/dashboard/technician-performance
        API->>DB: SELECT technician_id COUNT done GROUP BY technician
        DB-->>API: Data performa
        API-->>App: List teknisi dan jumlah selesai
    and Load tren booking
        App->>API: GET /api/v1/dashboard/booking-trends
        API->>DB: SELECT DATE created_at COUNT GROUP BY DATE
        DB-->>API: Data tren
        API-->>App: List tanggal dan jumlah
    end

    App-->>M: Render kartu statistik, grafik performa, grafik tren
